ll},{"id":"m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_10","text":"I was thinking about the exact same thing.","jump":"m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_11"},{"id":"m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_11","text":"I envisioned a sandy beach that was coarse, but soft at the same time...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_12","text":"The clear and cool","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_13","text":"salty ocean water...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_14","text":"It's kinda interesting, don't you think?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_15","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_15","text":"What?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_16","text":"I was thinking of the sea, so I decided to mix some salt into a glass of water and down it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_17","text":"Much to my surprise, the taste was totally different from seawater.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_18","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_18","text":"Why on earth are you drinking salt water?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_19","text":"I dunno.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_20","text":"I really miss the sea, I guess :/","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_21","text":"I figured the best way for me to experience it physically","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_22","text":"would be to drink some salt water.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_23","text":"Hmm...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_24","text":"Maybe I need to add more salt?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_25","text":"Wait just a second.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_26","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_26","text":"Anis, stop!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_27","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_27","text":"Anis doesn't answer for a while.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_28","text":"Ugh...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_29","text":"I only had one sip, but it was disgusting.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_30","text":"I had to down an entire bottle of normal water to wash away the flavor.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_31","text":"Blech...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_32","text":"What I'd give to go back in time and not do that.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_33","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_33","text":"Are you okay?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_34","text":"Do I sound okay?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_35","text":"I'm totally bummed out!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_36","text":"This experiment of mine is a total bust.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_37","text":"There's only one thing I can do.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_38","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_38","text":"?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_39","text":"Let's meet up.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_40","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_40","text":"Right now?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_sparklingsummer_03_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_sparklingsu